+    /// Every elicitation this session has raised, in arrival order.
+    ///
+    /// Mirrors `ElicitationStore::elicitations`, which is what the
+    /// connection-scoped store already exposes. A caller that wants to render
+    /// the pending ones outside the entry list would otherwise have to walk
